                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "|G| > pgl(N) forces genus > 0 by contrapositive. The threshold gap T − k upper-bounds the dropout count, which a DropoutWitness instance would realise. No instance can simultaneously have a large anonymity group, avoid the threshold gap, and recover from card dropout.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
