                  "name": "s1",
                  "fill": "#E8573F",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "① Gap measures speed: λ = 0.095 is the rate at which the last card-position bias decays per step.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ycLBW",
                  "name": "s2",
                  "fill": "#F3A842",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "② Gap controls mixing: after ~55 rounds of Q × Q × ... × Q, every non-uniform pattern has shrunk below 1%.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uXETB",
                  "name": "s3",
                  "fill": "#3B9B6D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "③ Mixing means security: the adversary sees the output permutation but it looks identical to a uniformly random permutation. No information about the secret leaks.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
