                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "QwTgm",
                          "name": "t1h",
                          "fill": "#0E2747",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Assume:  |G|  ≤  B(N)",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "textAlign": "center",
                          "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                          "fontSize": 22,
                          "fontWeight": "700"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "VFMoI",
                          "name": "t1b1",
                          "fill": "#0E2747",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "At write-time\n  |G| = 120,  B(N) = N·(N²−1)\n  N = 5  →  B = 120\n  Inequality holds with equality. Plausible.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "c1TbU",
                          "name": "t1b2",
                          "fill": "#0E2747",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Audit corrected the formula\n  B(N) = max(2N, 60)\n  N = 5  →  B = 60\n  Now reads:  120 ≤ 60.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LCRef",
                      "name": "take1",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "AI assumed the symmetry group behind our protocol fit within a known size bound. At write-time the formula for that bound happened to equal the group's actual size exactly, so the assumption held with equality and looked safe. The audit corrected the formula, the bound shrank below the group's size, and the assumption became impossible.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "textAlign": "center",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
