                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Anonymity set = the group G whose orbit hides the secret. PGL(2, Fq) is forced onto the projective line, so its order is q(q²-1) instead of the (q+1)! you would get from a free permutation group.",
