                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "QWij4",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Riemann-Hurwitz forces a threshold gap T - k that scales with the genus g of the covering curve. Genus 0 (the projective line) gives g = 0, so the gap collapses and T ≤ k.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "qTPB7",
