                  "name": "legendCard",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 220,
                  "fill": "#E8573F10",
                  "cornerRadius": 10,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 4,
                  "padding": [
                    12,
                    20
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vyIkm",
                      "name": "lhdr",
                      "fill": "#0E2747",
                      "content": "Reading the diagram",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "VWopJ",
                      "name": "lx",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "xᵢ: the five projective coordinates of P⁴",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "F9OmEJ",
                      "name": "lsig",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "σ ∈ S₅: a permutation, e.g. the 5-cycle (1 2 3 4 5)",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eCWwm",
                      "name": "lsym",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Symmetric polynomials Σ xᵢ, Σ xᵢ², Σ xᵢ³ are S₅-invariant",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "NXuQV",
                      "name": "laut",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Therefore S₅ maps Bring's curve to itself: S₅ ⊂ Aut(C)",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "BGjqV",
                      "name": "lhur",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "In fact Aut(C) = S₅ of order 120, the maximum for genus 4 by |Aut(C)| ≤ 84(g−1) = 252.",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "qOtkH",
                  "name": "qCard",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 130,
                  "fill": "#0E274710",
                  "cornerRadius": 10,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 4,
                  "padding": [
                    10,
                    20
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "hF4GR",
                      "name": "qhdr",
                      "fill": "#0E2747",
                      "content": "Same data, two languages",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "cr8Ps",
                      "name": "qg",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Group side: G = S₅, |G| = 120, generators and relations",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "xBfs8",
                      "name": "qc",
                      "fill": "#5B6680",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Curve side: C = Bring's curve ⊂ P⁴, three symmetric equations, g = 4",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "B9bNR",
      "x": 12488,
      "y": 7408,
      "name": "Slide 5c-ii - Why the curve, not just the group",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1080,
      "fill": "#F6F1E7",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 32,
      "padding": [
        60,
        120
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n7UKV",
          "name": "eyebrow",
          "fill": "#E8573F",
          "content": "02 / PROTOTYPING RESULTS",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "B1t8JB",
          "name": "title",
          "fill": "#0E2747",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Why the curve, not just the group",
          "lineHeight": 1.05,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 64,
          "fontWeight": "800",
          "letterSpacing": -2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xq1Cr",
          "name": "sub",
          "fill": "#5B6680",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The group permutes cards. The curve attaches numbers to those cards through a single function. Genus determines how many secret numbers that function can carry.",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "xRQpn",
          "name": "contentRow",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fill_container",
          "gap": 48,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "gLf7u",
              "name": "bullets",
              "width": 939,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 24,
              "padding": [
                20,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "T3TZbN",
                  "name": "b1",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "XglIA",
                      "name": "d1",
                      "fill": "#E8573F",
                      "content": "—",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "tI21o",
                      "name": "b1c",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 6,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "nv3hL",
                          "name": "b1m",
                          "fill": "#0E2747",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Group alone permutes the cards; the curve attaches values.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 28,
                          "fontWeight": "500"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "x4132x",
                          "name": "b1s",
                          "fill": "#9B9484",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "→ G shuffles card positions, but does not assign a number to any card. A curve C does: each card sits at a point on C, and the protocol fixes one function on C whose values at those points are the cards.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 22,
                          "fontWeight": "500",
                          "fontStyle": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Rw1AX",
                  "name": "b2",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "PvIqS",
                      "name": "d2",
                      "fill": "#E8573F",
                      "content": "—",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "dM1U2",
                      "name": "b2c",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 6,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "Xr0sY",
                          "name": "b2m",
                          "fill": "#0E2747",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "The secret is the eight numbers packed into that function.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 28,
                          "fontWeight": "500"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "dDRVP",
                          "name": "b2s",
                          "fill": "#9B9484",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "→ Bring's curve has four handles (genus g = 4). Any admissible function on it carries exactly 2g = 8 free numbers — the secret hand s₁, …, s₈. The encoder solves for the function that puts the secret in those eight slots and a small random pad in t_k = 4 more.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 22,
                          "fontWeight": "500",
                          "fontStyle": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "MKpuP",
                  "name": "b3",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "prNJc",
                      "name": "d3",
                      "fill": "#E8573F",
                      "content": "—",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "AgTLT",
                      "name": "b3c",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 6,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
