                          "fill": "#9B9484",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "→ Each of the thirteen helper-cards is one evaluation of the function. Below a privacy bound t_k = 4 cards, the eight secret numbers are jointly uniform. At the recovery bound t_T = 12 cards, the function is determined and so are the eight numbers. The gap t_T − t_k = 8 is twice the genus.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.4,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 22,
                          "fontWeight": "500",
                          "fontStyle": "italic"
                        },
