          "fill": "#5B6680",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Six stations orbit the ground once per loop. Only station 5 writes to the centre. Station 6 cuts in every few loops, feeds its findings back into station 1 by changing which source gets picked next, and rejoins the cycle. The centre gets visibly thicker each pass until no remaining strand of knowledge moves it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
