          "id": "T3E1O",
          "name": "foot",
          "fill": "#9B9484",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "* Two revealed cards give two results: what you learn depends on which two positions you flip, not just how many. Adjacent positions {0,1} leak 0.154 bits, spread positions {0,2} leak 0.119. Values are averages over all deals and cuts.",
